# This app needs no configuration or API keys: it uses only keyless public tile
# services and bundled public datasets.
#
# The shared notes board (netlify/functions/notes.mts) also needs no variables.
# Netlify connects Functions to Netlify Blobs automatically, both when deployed and
# under `npm run dev:netlify`. There is no passcode: access is the unguessable board
# ID in the share link.
#
# If a setting is ever added, define it here with an empty value, read it in code,
# and put real values in a local, gitignored .env (or the Netlify UI for deploys).
# Anything prefixed VITE_ is bundled into the public site, so never use it for secrets.
